          <summary>Unfortunately, the official details</summary>
          <p>For forms that refuse to accept “Dutch company-shaped object” as a legal entity type.</p>
          <div class="legal-grid" id="company-details">
            <div class="legal-item"><span>Legal name</span><strong>HRWILLMOTT</strong></div>
            <div class="legal-item"><span>Chamber of Commerce</span><strong>KvK 87558467</strong></div>
            <div class="legal-item"><span>VAT number</span><strong>NL004438663B04</strong></div>
            <div class="legal-item"><span>Based in</span><strong>Amsterdam, mostly</strong></div>
          </div>
          <button class="copy-button" type="button" data-copy-details>Copy company details</button>
          <p class="status legal-note" id="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </details>

        <details class="panel contact" id="contact">
          <summary>Send a message</summary>
          <p>Useful messages, admin things, and real-world reasons to connect.</p>
          <form id="contact-form" method="post" action="/api/contact">
            <label>
              Name
              <input name="name" autocomplete="name" required />
            </label>
            <label>
              Email
              <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
